# Shoulder on FHIR — Profiles, CodeSystems, ValueSets
# VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client)
# Tenant endpoint: http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT
# PREREQUISITE: run ./seed/load-profiles.sh before using these

@base = http://localhost:8080/fhir/DEFAULT


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BASE PROFILES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### ShoulderPatient
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/shoulder-patient
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### RotatorCuffCondition
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-condition
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### RotatorCuffProcedure
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-procedure
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### ShoulderObservation (abstract base)
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/shoulder-observation
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### RotatorCuffQuestionnaireResponse
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-questionnaire-response
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### ShoulderImagingStudy
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/shoulder-imaging-study
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### ShoulderCoverage
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/shoulder-coverage
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### RotatorCuffResearchCarePlan
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-research-care-plan
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### RotatorCuffRegistrationBundle
GET {{base}}/StructureDefinition/rotator-cuff-registration-bundle
Accept: application/fhir+json

