# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VALUESET EXPANSION — verify terminology service
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Expand RotatorCuffDiagnosis (SNOMED codes — requires HAPI to have network or cached expansion)
GET {{base}}/ValueSet/rotator-cuff-diagnosis/$expand
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Expand ShoulderLaterality
GET {{base}}/ValueSet/shoulder-laterality/$expand
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Expand GoutallierClassification
GET {{base}}/ValueSet/goutallier-classification/$expand
Accept: application/fhir+json

###

### Expand PositiveNegative
GET {{base}}/ValueSet/positive-negative/$expand
Accept: application/fhir+json
